{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're a newly hired janitor working in a research facility for [REDACTED], your shift takes a turn when a doll-like creature suddenly breaks out of its containment. You're offered by a mysterious person a way to get out of the facility in return for capturing or killing the creature. However things didn't go as planned, and you're outmatched against the creature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you survive the creature and escape or be eaten like the others ?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Escape from Bonnie:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Survival is your only goal. Run if you must. Hide if you can. But never try outrunning him, you'll only be running to his dinner plate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735770/extras/SCK-GIF1.gif?t=1748388812\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Investigate the Facility:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the depths of the facility you once called your workplace. Search for scattered notes left behind by those who came before you. Piece together the truth and uncover the facility true intentions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735770/extras/SCK-GIF2.gif?t=1748388812\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735770?t=1748388812","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3735770?t=1748388812","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735770/fbcf083bd46019222ece5f0315d77aaae8675e86/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748388812","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3735770/fbcf083bd46019222ece5f0315d77aaae8675e86/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748388812","categorie